"Lookup Table Demo"
"Demonstrates INTERPOLATE, LOOKUP, NLOOKUPROWS, aggregate functions"
"Table 1 (lookup_demo.csv): saturated steam properties"
"Table 2 (lookup_demo_watercp.csv): liquid water specific heat"

"Interpolate enthalpy from temperature"
T_in = 150  "°C"
h_interp = INTERPOLATE('lookup_demo', 'T_C', 'h_kJ_per_kg', T_in)

"Number of rows in table"
n_rows = NLOOKUPROWS('lookup_demo')

"Number of columns in table"
n_cols = NLOOKUPCOLUMNS('lookup_demo')

"Direct cell access: pressure at row 3 (T=140°C)"
P_row3 = LOOKUP('lookup_demo', 3, 2)

"Column index for enthalpy column (should be 3)"
col_h = LOOKUPCOL('lookup_demo', 'h_kJ_per_kg')

"Second lookup: interpolate entropy from the same table"
s_interp = INTERPOLATE('lookup_demo', 'T_C', 's_kJ_per_kgK', T_in)

"Third lookup: from a second table — liquid water specific heat (lookup_demo_watercp.csv)"
Cp_water = INTERPOLATE('lookup_demo_watercp', 'T_C', 'Cp_kJ_per_kgK', T_in)

"Aggregate functions on enthalpy column"
sum_h = SUMLOOKUP('lookup_demo', 3)
avg_h = AVGLOOKUP('lookup_demo', 3)
max_h = MAXLOOKUP('lookup_demo', 3)
min_h = MINLOOKUP('lookup_demo', 3)
